    "body": "In this episode of Denatured, you’ll hear from Jennifer McMahon, partner at Seroba and Joey Mason, venture partner at Claret Capital. We dig into how venture debt buys time when equity can’t and how Europe’s funding gaps, tranching habits and slower urgency shape who uses it well.\n> Listen on Spotify > Listen on Apple Podcasts > Listen on Amazon Music > Watch on YouTube\nIn this episode of Denatured, you’ll listen to Jennifer McMahon, partner at Seroba and Joey Mason, venture partner at Claret Capital. We look at why venture debt now sits at the center of late‑stage biotech financing and how Europe’s capital constraints force companies to treat time as their most expensive asset.\nHost\n⁠ Jennifer C. Smith-Parker , Director of Insights, BioSpace\nGuests\nJennifer McMahon , Partner, Seroba\nJoey Mason , Venture Partner, Claret Capital\nDisclaimer: The views expressed in this discussion by guests are their own and do not represent those of their organizations.",
